{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-15_beg","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-15","title":"核心舱攻防战","storyCode":"14-17","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-15_beg.txt","sourceHash":"98b2cb39aa739c3c49ccdb81a3dcedfcee296c1d5bc33466296708db18d8e6df","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"阿米娅跨过了那些来自过去巴别塔的敌人，赶到了博士和W的身边。凯尔希也成功脱困，与众人会合。阿米娅看到了死魂灵的一生，并最终直面死魂灵。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经坚持了很久——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉重的喘息）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但你不可能继续撑下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉重的喘息）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阴影吞噬了他，来自过去的幽灵们将他重新拉入人群之中。\n然后更多的幽灵自阴影中钻出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们还是不愿放弃吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经没有可以放弃的东西了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们本可以一拥而上，但你们没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从你们的身上没有看到任何的愤怒，但悲伤淹没了你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们和那位死魂灵，很不一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们不为杀死你们而在此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们只为在此见证她的成功。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，但我必须过去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色波纹自阿米娅的身边荡开，挤压着阴影。\n阿米娅缓缓向前走去，无视了从身旁划过的刀刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是她的继承者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽灵们不断地逼近阿米娅，又不断地自她身边被推开，跌落回阴影之中。\n阿米娅往前走去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......凯尔希医生......特蕾西娅小姐......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"她触碰到了那片阴影。\n她看到了走廊尽头那扇彻底结晶化的门，以及直冲自己而来的刀刃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色在她的手掌中汇聚，随即她握住了那刀刃......\n握住了无尽的悲伤。\n她已看到，来自过去的悲伤——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下......死了......怎么可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们失败了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下......因我们的失职而死——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"将死的刺客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你......还活着......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我能感受到他的手死死拽着我的领子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"将死的刺客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"殿下......死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"将死的刺客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"使命......完成了？使命......完成了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"将死的刺客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"将死的刺客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"了结我。你不想为殿下......复仇吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"我胸口那里还放着一枚手雷......那个疯女人扔给我，让我保护殿下。\n只要我......只要——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴别塔成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我不知道自己犹豫了多长时间。\n但直到他自己垂下了手，失去了最后的气息......\n我才意识到，那个疯女人说得没错——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"废物。懦夫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我已经忘记离开巴别塔后，我们在荒野上流浪了多久。\n直到我们遇见了一批四处征兵的王庭军。他们说，殿下回来了，与特雷西斯站在一起......\n我们便已经知道，我们应该去哪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_victoria"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们怀着愤怒而来，向我诘问，为何要向我们的同胞散布谎言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那便上前来，到我面前来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向我展示你们的愤怒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"走到特雷西斯面前的阶梯很长，王庭的主宰们冷漠地注视着我。\n但我未曾停步。\n我不再是一个懦夫。我会将自己的愤怒倾泻在特雷西斯的面前，然后死在他的剑下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我走到他的面前，但迎接我的却不是他的剑。\n特雷西斯只是点了点头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保持你们的愤怒，但你们有更好的方式去宣泄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你们所听到的，并不是谎言。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子们，你们找到了我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"我在那时明白了很多事情。殿下死了，但那位拉住我手的人也的确是殿下。\n真相比之谎言更加让我痛苦。\n从心底弥漫开来的悲哀轻易摧毁了我的愤怒。\n殿下......\n曾经我们立誓想要保护的殿下......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我看到了她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"透过你的眼睛......你的人生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都死了？我仅剩的同伴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，他们先我一步离开。至少他们忠于自己的使命，为守护殿下而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也会如此，阿米娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你们——我尊敬你们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的过去已经不复存在，我们选择了和那些可耻的人同流合污。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们甘愿抛弃一切，唯有如此我们才能心安理得地继续站在殿下的身前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为此......我们抹去了自己的姓名，穿上了这身曾经最为痛恨的衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我亦有需要保护的人，我不能停下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你试图阻止殿下......唯有跨过我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕仅剩我一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在心软。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果连我都不敢面对，你凭什么认为自己敢面对殿下，“魔王”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你迟早要面对自己的命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当我决定踏上这艘舰艇时，就已经下定了决心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的悲伤，萨卡兹的悲伤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该结束了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"来自过去的幽灵终于倒在了阴影之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"飞空艇的“幽灵”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请安息——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这是......手雷？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"您说，萨卡兹有一个新的未来。\n我们本是需要被焚尽的腐朽，那又为何不能为您所描绘的那个理想而燃烧呢？\n我们曾在巴别塔失败过一次，便不会再失败第二次。\n我们会保护您。\n死亡会见证我们的承诺。\n懦夫不会食言，特蕾西娅殿下......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g10_airshipwitchcraftcore"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁在这会儿瞎玩我的手雷？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不要分心，死魂灵的影子试图把你拽入黑暗中！","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，比起这些甩都甩不掉的鬼东西，我更讨厌那个话痨鬼一直在我耳边叨叨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老东西，你要是再不闭嘴，我非把你的老窝拆成碎片不可。"}]},{"label":"小心！我们似乎不能对它造成实质性伤害。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的核心被那些黑色的影子死死保护着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寻常的爆破伤不到它。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}，它的精神压迫对你不起作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别告诉我你什么办法都没想出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......我对死魂灵并没有这么了解。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"有更合适的专家能帮我们处理。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，Mon3tr躲去哪了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"专注原本的计划，继续爆破核心舱室。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我对它有另外的安排。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像猜到你的计划了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，那不如让场面更热闹点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，这样我可没工夫护你了，兜帽人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自求多福吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"W高举手中的发射器，飞射而出的每一枚弹药都散发着威胁的气息。\n每一寸穹顶，每一根长柱，每一个区域......\n爆炸物转瞬便附着于你们目之所及的所有区域。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"毫无意义！\n死魂灵愤怒地低吼。\n这些人不配他倾泻自己的愤怒，他的愤怒本应留给苦难的原点。\n苦难的原点会铭记他的愤怒，传承他的愤怒，在他用死亡解脱自己的瞬间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"滚出去！\n阴影的浪潮从舱室的每一个角落涌起。\n自核心处流淌而出的，源源不断的阴影包裹住了所有的爆炸物——\n黑暗裹挟着爆炸扑向你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"爆炸在黑色的浪潮中激起一个又一个隆起的气泡，如同冲向你的怪物躯体上的脓包。\n阴影已近在眼前。\n你看向W。她终于向黑暗抛出了自己最后一枚闪光弹——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随后，黑暗笼罩了你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"唉，说不定这次之后我又得躺几天。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我相信......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"一丝微弱的亮光从黑暗的缝隙中透了出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我在这里——","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"接下来就交给你了——","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"破碎的源石碎屑从你的背后飞溅而出。\n一根黑色的丝线随即而至，贯穿了黑色的浪潮，找到了你。\n丝线缠绕上了你的手，你的全身......\n将你彻底拉出了阴影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你们的信号。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我终于找到你了，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，你来得比我想象中要慢啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你一直保护博士，W小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，请交给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又和您见面了，死魂灵......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"滚出这里！\n滚出我的身体！\n阿米娅自黑暗的浪潮中捕捉到了他的情绪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i12"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她看到了充斥着愤怒的投影。\n死魂灵将自己的情绪凝为长矛的虚影，悬于四处。\n可为何......愤怒之下还隐藏着更深的情绪？\n一种无比熟悉的情绪，一种与那些已然消逝的幽灵们所共鸣的情绪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"异族的魔王！\n你胆敢落下虚伪的泪水——\n你，又凭何，为萨卡兹的悲哀而悲哀！\n死魂灵的手中，长矛几乎快要凝聚为实体。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"数千年的使命必将终结于我的手中。\n无人被容许妨碍——\n我们所要见证的——\n宿命终结！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的泪水，为那些逝去的巴别塔幽灵而落下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也为您而落，死魂灵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的法术在她的身前聚集。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您曾问我，为何要试图阻止这场战争......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我现在可以回答您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已经看到未来的路。而这场战争，不应属于萨卡兹的未来——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"虚伪！\n死魂灵将所有的恨，所有的怒，所有的痛苦尽数握于手中......\n长矛已然凝聚为实体。\n他将自己的一生掷向阿米娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"长矛刺破了黑色的屏障，贯穿了她的身体。\n庞杂而又永无边际的情绪海洋瞬间淹没了阿米娅......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她看到了燃烧的熔炉最深处的火焰。\n她看到了失去头颅的空洞巨铠在天灾中逆行，身后拖拽的祭祀古石在大地上留下漫长的痕迹。\n她看到了神民的术法划过天际，将石质的城墙碾为齑粉。\n她看见一个萨卡兹。\n他背靠着巨石而立。家园的基石，卡兹戴尔的碎片。\n那个萨卡兹向他的王呐喊道："},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡兹戴尔就在我的身后，他们无法夺去。\n贪婪的“霸主”想要这片土地，那便来取吧。\n但是王啊，你说过，除去废墟，他们带不走任何东西。\n我的眼泪已经流干，我的胸膛中跳动的只有愤怒。\n我会留下，我会守住这片土地，在死亡之前。\n这是我的使命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅看到了萨卡兹将手指向冷漠以待的神民。\n她看到了“霸主”在神民的簇拥下冲向了卡兹戴尔的人群。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"呐喊声。哭喊声。无力的喘息声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我的眼泪明明已经流干，我的胸膛中跳动的本该只有愤怒......\n可为什么我依旧在为我们族群的消亡而痛苦？\n王啊，我不会在这道守卫的阵线上退后半步——\n阿米娅看过那段残酷的历史。\n她看过，初代魔王引爆了那前所未有的天灾，所有围攻这座城市的“霸主”与他们的军队在同一天消失......\n一同消失的还有那位王与他的誓死效忠的子民。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"可为何那场遮蔽天空的漆黑天灾蒸发了我的躯体，却又没有让我死去？\n那道光，在卡兹戴尔的土石上永远烙印下了我的影子。\n死亡背叛了我，我已成了家园永恒的阴影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的使命已经结束了......那座城市已经成为往日的虚影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......结束？\n不，在死亡归复于我之前，在萨卡兹的宿命改写之前，使命没有终结。\n阿米娅的泪水被风暴拭去。\n她看到了一个萨卡兹——在大地上徘徊九千年，等待完成自己使命的萨卡兹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我看到了真正的您——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死魂灵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的确并非萨卡兹，但萨卡兹的痛苦，我同样切身感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我所背负的这顶王冠，我不愿意放弃的未来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从未有一刻将萨卡兹排除在外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会终结一切苦难。这就是我对您的回应！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无尽的黑暗空间之中，贯穿阿米娅的长矛被黑色的丝线缠绕，拉出。\n阿米娅牵引着长矛，用尽所有的力量将其掷回核心的方向。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g10_airshipwitchcraftcore"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"长矛撕裂了黑暗，黑色的浪潮从阿米娅身边退去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，你破开了禁锢！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你撕开了包裹你的阴影。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕小兔子做的没有这么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只能用死魂灵自己的情绪短暂地封锁它片刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们得想办法彻底......结束死魂灵的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别看我，我已经试过用炸弹把这里都犁一遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对付他，我们并非完全束手无策。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"看来Mon3tr成功了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（兴奋的高鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你时机把握得很准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们吸引了死魂灵的所有注意力之后，他对我的控制自然就放松了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr也终于能够感应到我的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（兴奋地挥舞）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也感谢你，W，你为博士争取了时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我还有很多账要和他算——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么情况！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......你们有没有感觉到......飞空艇在加速？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"飞空艇在试图挣脱骸骨！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是死魂灵......他快要脱困了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......特蕾西娅在帮助他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来她的谋划已经到最后的关键阶段了，死魂灵在回应她的呼唤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没在这里找到她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论她是否在此，我们的计划都不该受到影响。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们必须解除死魂灵对飞空艇的控制。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。现在最有效的办法，就是拆除核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失去了控制和引擎的飞空艇才有被阻止的可能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，请站到我的身后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这老东西真难缠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是给他搬个家嘛，听上去也没那么复杂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"（古老的萨卡兹语）使命......\n（古老的萨卡兹语）宿命......\n（古老的萨卡兹语）终结......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡兹戴尔最古老的护卫已经从束缚中苏醒。\n魔王让他抓住了自己九千年前的一丝灵光。\n他从未如此刻一般清醒，他从未忘记。\n他不再用愤怒掩盖悲伤。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我会终结你们，也会终结我们的宿命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
